["obj", "GroupData::get_auto_explore@0070c1b0", "--item", "2782", "--win", "2508", "--own", "1", "--ptrarg", "0:4", "--ptrarg-null", "0", "--stub", "0x70d000:0", "--stub", "0x70ccb0:1", "--stub", "slot:0x18:0", "--at", "0xee1510:8", "--ptrtab", "0xc0ab84+m[0x4a]*0x1c:4:0x20:vt", "--ptrtab", "0xc0aec0+m[0x4a]*0x1c:4:0x70", "--wbias", "m+12:0..3", "--wbias", "m+72:0,0,0,0x10000,0x10000,0x100,0x10100", "--answer-range", "0:0:3", "--answer-range", "1:-1:3", "--answer-range", "2:0:1", "--seq", "0:8", "--seq", "1:2", "--seq", "2:4", "--wbias", "m+2252:0x0,0x10000,0x20000,0x30000,0x1,0x10001,0x20001,0x30001,0x2,0x10002,0x20002,0x30002,0x3,0x10003,0x20003,0x30003", "--wbias", "m+2256:0x0,0x10000,0x20000,0x30000,0x1,0x10001,0x20001,0x30001,0x2,0x10002,0x20002,0x30002,0x3,0x10003,0x20003,0x30003", "--wbias", "m+2260:0x0,0x10000,0x20000,0x30000,0x1,0x10001,0x20001,0x30001,0x2,0x10002,0x20002,0x30002,0x3,0x10003,0x20003,0x30003", "--port", "{
                // `buildings` answers 0 with `*out = 1`. Else `get_num_const` (stub 0, a[4..]) under two is the
                // leader arm: `num > 0`, the leader (stub 1, a[12]) in range and its object's flag +8 set, then
                // bit 8 of the unit's word +0x68; any other answers 0 with `*out = 1`. Over one it zeroes the image's
                // `counts`, walks the entries `get_num_const` says (asked again after each), counts those whose
                // slot +0x18 (stub 2, a[14..]) answers by the unit's bit 8, and answers 1 when counts[1] > 0 and
                // counts[0] <= counts[1]; `*out` is then `bVar5 < 2`, bVar5 = (counts[0] > 0) + (counts[1] > 0).
                let (mut c0, mut c2) = (0usize, 0usize);
                let list = |k: usize| usize::try_from(i16::from_le_bytes([m[0x8cc + 2 * k], m[0x8cd + 2 * k]])).expect("an index");
                let bit8 = |u: &[u8]| usize::from(u[0x69] & 1);
